{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29047","headline":"春日郊园戏赠杨嘏评事 · 许浑","name":"春日郊园戏赠杨嘏评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十里蒹葭入薜萝，春风谁许暂鸣珂。\n相如渴後狂还减，曼倩归来语更多。\n门枕碧溪冰皓耀，槛齐青嶂雪嵯峨。\n野桥沽酒茅檐醉，谁羡红楼一曲歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}